{"ID":"20240511110539-478e974","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240511110539-478e974","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511110539-478e974\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511114630-jtake50\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511132554-1zmy29h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513125523-uprw8qr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:20\u0026#125;","title":"汉唐-050号（牙痛止痛剂）","type":"doc","updated":"20240513125525"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240511114630-jtake50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114630-jtake50","updated":"20240511114630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此药的研发是针对牙齿疼痛设计的 , 可配合附子粉刷牙(有坚齿功能) , 能够有效的停止牙痛 , 如果牙齿已经腐烂败坏 , 必须找专业牙医拔掉或修补 , 但是一般如果牙医治疗後仍然有馀痛 , 依旧可以服用此药来止痛 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511114630-iby5jwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114630-iby5jwu","updated":"20240511114638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"造成牙齿疼痛的原因有许多 , 如果是蛀牙必须要找牙医来填补 , 或抽取神经 , 如果牙龈肿大 , 可做根管治疗放出脓液 , 但是如果不是以上原因 , 牙齿仍痛 , 大多数是神经受到湿液挤压或者有脓在深处 , 此际就可以使用汉唐-50号 , 此药结合了排脓除湿收敛伤口的药 , 再加上中药的止痛药 , 因此效果明显 , 完全没有如西药止痛药伤及肝脏般的副作用 ,   有些人对西药过敏 , 也可以利用此药来取代西药止痛药 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511114630-ursrxcg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114630-ursrxcg","updated":"20240511114635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方内容 : 细辛 , 赤豆 , 黄连 ....................."}]},{"ID":"20240511114630-cdwgui8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114630-cdwgui8","updated":"20240511114641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禁忌 : 无 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511114630-ju8x6vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511114630-ju8x6vz","updated":"20240511114633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服用方法 : 早晚餐後30粒 , 严重的痛可加强到一日四次 , 每次40粒 , 无论饭前或饭後 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511132552-1d3qaen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132552-1d3qaen"}},{"ID":"20240513125523-uprw8qr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513125523-uprw8qr","updated":"20240513125525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"牙痛止痛劑，類似於仙豐製作的芬芳50號。"}]},{"ID":"20240511132553-zawzdug","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240511132553-zawzdug"}},{"ID":"20240511132554-gh3zr2y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-gh3zr2y","updated":"20240511132556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-50　牙痛止痛剂"}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-iokpoj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-iokpoj3","updated":"20240511132554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2006.12.04B　录校：孟磊）"}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-qglus09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-qglus09","updated":"20240511132554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们讲汉唐五十号，这两天没事的时候，我配玉华丸，但机器保险丝坏了,明天换一个."}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-vxbdcu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-vxbdcu4","updated":"20240511132554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五十号是治牙痛的，牙痛不是病，疼起来真要命。我在春节的时候就发过一次，怎幺发的？过年了回到家，和几个朋友一起，几年没见了，吃烧烤喝凉啤酒，三个人吃了四盘料理，辣椒加孜然粉，当天晚上牙疼的不得了，当天晚上用小柴胡，柴胡用到一百二十八克，一剂药吃下后，好了。春节完了回到郑州，到高速公路，由于上路，早晨六点一直到十二点，在高速路下等了六小时，正好车里闷,又晒了太阳，回到郑州后牙又疼了，然后用黄元御治牙疼的，一剂药治好了。这牙痛确实是痛到脑中，而且半个脸肿着，真是厉害!"}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-odkmqeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-odkmqeb","updated":"20240511154012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"此药的研发是针对牙齿疼痛设计的, 可配合附子粉刷牙(有坚齿功能) ,"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-spdijbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-spdijbu","updated":"20240511132554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是倪海厦的创举，附子打粉,当成药膏刷牙.以前我用的牙膏刷牙，我用的方法是白矾粉加食盐，坚持一段时间后，牙齿的坚齿功能特别好，同时还有去污浊的作用，我是经常抽烟的，牙齿有黑点，其它朋友抽的黑去洗牙，看似白了，但不是真白，很难看。用白矾粉加食盐，一段时间后，牙齿就特别白，健康的白色.现在懒了，两年没用这方法了。另外用白矾粉刷牙时嘴里不太好受，白矾属于酸涩，整个嘴里面发涩，感觉味道不是太好.要是坚持用白矾粉加食盐刷牙，可以说口腔疾病都不会生。另外，口腔溃疡，直接用生白矾，在嘴中化了后吐出，不要咽下，一次后，口腔溃疡就会好，但口中含白矾不好受，它可以直接清心火.倪海厦用附子粉刷，我没用过，民间中医有帖子说用附子粉刷牙，有谁刷过一段时间的可把功效写一下."}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-l1iwdgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-l1iwdgu","updated":"20240511154018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"能够有效的停止牙痛 , 如果牙齿已经腐烂败坏 , 必须找专业牙医拔掉或修补 , 但是一般如果牙医治疗后仍然有余痛 , 依旧可以服用此药来止痛 。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-i6zveq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-i6zveq5","updated":"20240511154019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"造成牙齿疼痛的原因有许多 , 如果是蛀牙必须要找牙医来填补 , 或抽取神经 ,"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-c8qclsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-c8qclsv","updated":"20240511132554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"抽取神经，我不赞同，对人伤害太大，不能取"}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-42dt0bh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-42dt0bh","updated":"20240511154029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果牙龈肿大 , 可做根管治疗放出脓液 , 但是如果不是以上原因 , 牙齿仍痛 , 大多数是神经受到湿液挤压或者有脓在深处 , 此际就可以使用汉唐-50号 , 此药结合了排脓除湿收敛伤口的药 , 再加上中药的止痛药 , 因此效果明显 , 完全没有如西药止痛药伤及肝脏般的副作用 ,   有些人对西药过敏 , 也可以利用此药来取代西药止痛药 ."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-rtzd3do","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-rtzd3do","updated":"20240511132554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于中药补牙的办法，我前段时间想研究一下，因为造药粉比较麻烦就没研究，中药补牙的办法就是牙齿有洞能不能补上，好，这是属于汉唐五十号."}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-tvzehgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-tvzehgq","updated":"20240511154032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"处方内容 : 细辛 , 赤豆 , 黄连 ....................."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-1mlfv4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-1mlfv4g","updated":"20240511154033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"禁    忌 : 无 ."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511132554-1zmy29h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511132554-1zmy29h","updated":"20240511154034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"服用方法 : 早晚餐后30粒 , 严重的痛可加强到一日四次 , 每次40粒 , 无论饭前或饭后 ."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]}]}